Lets skate-host report each jump's spin with the score: the skater's own half
turns (the animated skeleton's root heading, so a shuvit or varial board spin
doesn't count; the same tolerance short of each 180 the scoring uses), signed
counter-clockwise from above, plus the stance the jump left the ground in, a
jump counter and a trick counter, so the addon's HUD can name spins the way
Skate 3 does ("Kickflip 360", "FS Half-Cab"). The score's own spin points are
unchanged. Applied on top of skate-host-hud.patch and skate-host-stance.patch
(it adds fields to their Score). Same license as the files it changes
(Apache-2.0).

